@startuml
title Delete Word Audio Sequence (/api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId})

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary Page\n(Dashboard)" as VocabularyPage
control "VocabularyController\n(Dashboard)" as DashboardController
control "ServiceAPI\n(Dashboard)" as ServiceApi
control "AdminWordsController\n(API)" as ApiController
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over VocabularyPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard route is POST /vocabulary/{id}/audio/{audioId}/delete.
ServiceAPI calls DELETE /api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId}.
No request DTO body is used; API returns bool in the response envelope.
Delete is soft delete: audio status becomes deleted.
end note

Admin -> VocabularyPage: Click Delete audio
VocabularyPage -> DashboardController: POST /vocabulary/{id}/audio/{audioId}/delete
DashboardController -> ServiceApi: DeleteAudioAsync(wordId, audioId)
ServiceApi -> ApiController: DELETE /api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId}
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> WordService: SoftDeleteAudioAsync(wordId, audioId)

WordService -> WordRepository: SetAudioStatusAsync(wordId, audioId, deleted)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Find audio asset
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Audio row or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result

alt Audio asset not found or already deleted
    WordRepository --> WordService: false
    WordService --> ApiController: NotFound result
    ApiController --> ServiceApi: HTTP 404 error
    ServiceApi --> DashboardController: Action failed
    DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Audio asset found
    WordRepository -> DbContext: Set audio status deleted
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE word_audio_assets
    MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
    DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
    WordRepository --> WordService: true
    WordService --> ApiController: Success result
    ApiController --> ServiceApi: HTTP 200 OK
    ServiceApi --> DashboardController: Action success
    DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show audio removed feedback
end

@enduml
